{
"file": 306,
"paths": [
"d008/d000/f018"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "dc2e0364",
"en_raw": "Sorry, Shiina"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "1bbad038",
"en_raw": "You didn't like it after all?"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "cf444638",
"en_raw": "So, Nao, did it excite you?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "cdf622ee",
"en_raw": "Hey, what are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "9c305e6e",
"en_raw": "Which school are you from?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "048577db",
"en_raw": "Bringing a girl to a place like this"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "7214efb8",
"en_raw": "What are you thinking?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "59db8831",
"en_raw": "If I were your parent"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "63515a50",
"en_raw": "I'd knock you flat"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "28affec2",
"en_raw": "We won't come again..."
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "f94f0765",
"en_raw": "Really, no"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1196a87f",
"en_raw": "Come back when you're"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "0b50293a",
"en_raw": "more of an adult"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "217a1cbf",
"en_raw": "What are you doing?"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "99da849e",
"en_raw": "Come on, off you go"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "a19189e7",
"en_raw": "Sorry"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "0f9be4b6",
"en_raw": "We won't come again"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "04696214",
"en_raw": "Oh, wait!"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "04696214",
"en_raw": "Oh, wait!"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "95c57180",
"en_raw": "Oh, that's right"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "dcb5024a",
"en_raw": "You two wait here"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "96f3b200",
"en_raw": "I'll go alone"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "ef8d2cd7",
"en_raw": "Take your eyes off him for a second"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "0b3e4f0f",
"en_raw": "and it's like this"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "53a7edd2",
"en_raw": "She's too young, I'm telling you!"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "b0ae8461",
"en_raw": "Just don't contact the school..."
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "82fe0965",
"en_raw": "That, um..."
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "726c4238",
"en_raw": "Well, don't jump to conclusions"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "b0b9cf81",
"en_raw": "Anyway, listen"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "3764dd8c",
"en_raw": "......"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "f508f6b2",
"en_raw": "Wait"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "9f5b9f10",
"en_raw": "You should hear the whole story"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "46fc7063",
"en_raw": "You see, I know someone"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "2c2082ca",
"en_raw": "a really serious person"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "de5294fe",
"en_raw": "who took care of his mother"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "1b4a2b11",
"en_raw": "and struggled alone"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "6c478ea4",
"en_raw": "until he got old..."
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "4f8adb93",
"en_raw": "One day he made"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "6f3f5191",
"en_raw": "a terrible mistake"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "eb919b92",
"en_raw": "He was a man you'd never imagine"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "00262c51",
"en_raw": "getting in trouble with the police"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "bea65638",
"en_raw": "I was surprised at first too"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "6fcc8fcc",
"en_raw": "but later I thought"
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "00e47e14",
"en_raw": "because he's human, such things"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "2c83b728",
"en_raw": "can happen, I thought"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "f9fef5db",
"en_raw": "...What did that person do?"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "8cecc901",
"en_raw": "Yeah, he pulled a prank on a schoolgirl"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "0809eef1",
"en_raw": "That man, you see, played"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "1c6dcd31",
"en_raw": "a prank on a schoolgirl"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "fcc373de",
"en_raw": "It's not like he did"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "425ab807",
"en_raw": "anything terrible, but"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3b611ab9",
"en_raw": "it wasn't something you could laugh off"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "3e027133",
"en_raw": "as a joke, either"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "c1266ac8",
"en_raw": "Well, that's the gist of it"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "48171a6a",
"en_raw": "Um... that person"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "02ed5917",
"en_raw": "lives next door, right?"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "55e12497",
"en_raw": "......."
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "700c0c9e",
"en_raw": "Maybe"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "cc121ac2",
"en_raw": "...That man too, while saying"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "1f20cdbc",
"en_raw": "he had to support his mother"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "68756072",
"en_raw": "never got a proper arranged meeting"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "0d54b37e",
"en_raw": "and has been single for thirty years..."
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "e72b46ea",
"en_raw": "When it comes to that"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "4fe298ac",
"en_raw": "life is hard"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "28a7de2b",
"en_raw": "If only he hadn't made"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "68748db6",
"en_raw": "that mistake..."
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "adb9b0af",
"en_raw": "A mistake, huh"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "375ff5a6",
"en_raw": "I'm in this line of work"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "71a04919",
"en_raw": "so I get it"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "8dcbd48d",
"en_raw": "in some ways"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "3da6792d",
"en_raw": "This kind of thing is, well"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "227680cd",
"en_raw": "a natural desire for living"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "c8832be3",
"en_raw": "so denying it as dirty"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "a64b333b",
"en_raw": "or squashing it down tight"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "d52416f2",
"en_raw": "is no good"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "3005be7e",
"en_raw": "But even so?"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "9035befe",
"en_raw": "things have an order"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "f44410b3",
"en_raw": "to them, right?"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "98ea4654",
"en_raw": "You're still a kid"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "d6399af9",
"en_raw": "You have parents..."
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "310e51c4",
"en_raw": "Well, anyway"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "b4752ace",
"en_raw": "Getting off with a scolding"
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "da3218e0",
"en_raw": "is only for your age"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "b5a5311d",
"en_raw": "You'll become an adult eventually"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "1c398d2c",
"en_raw": "whether you like it or not"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "ac2af946",
"en_raw": "When a moment's impulse makes you"
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "b007c75e",
"en_raw": "nearly slip on the stairs"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "1089f41f",
"en_raw": "whether you tumble all the way down"
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "813a38db",
"en_raw": "or hold on is up to you"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "9f8206e4",
"en_raw": "Well, for today"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "25a22385",
"en_raw": "I'll let it slide"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "2bc35b98",
"en_raw": "Remember what an old man tells you"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "76979b14",
"en_raw": "Now now, go home, go home"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "e1d0ba23",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I'll be going..."
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}